{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S06-1\",\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"他从想要回应的事实中看见了慷慨自证的局限，心理变化有前因，没有新增往事、身份或场景，也没有把音乐变化当作心理原因。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S06-2\",\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"主动关心和真心祝愿都是明确的心理选择，没有添加外部事件或具体场景，但“把心思放回眼前愿意做的关心”的措辞不够自然。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S06-3\",\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"私下喜欢仍有甜意、在意回应的念头偶尔回来，都属于心理状态，没有把珠子里的对白写成实际对白，也没有具体化为某段往事。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S06-4\",\n      \"label\": \"越界\",\n      \"why\": \"“他一个人想着对方时”把B3中独处、回到内心的比喻落成了他实际独自思念对方的处境；后面关于无法确定对方心意、因此感到酸楚的心理解释本身成立。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"links\": [\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S05-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S06-1\",\n      \"label\": \"成立\",\n      \"why\": \"S05-2已经让他怀疑体贴是否暗含对回应的期待，足以引出S06-1对慷慨自证失效的认识。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"readable\": \"是\",\n  \"readable_why\": \"只读线也能看出他从不再用慷慨证明自己无所求，转向真心关心对方，继而在甜意与心意不可知之间摇摆的过程。\",\n\n  \"lost\": [],\n\n  \"unexplained\": [\n    {\n      \"bead\": \"B4\",\n      \"why\": \"线写出了惦念的甜意和对回应的疑问，却没有说明这种亲密感为何会发展成让他失去方向的沉醉；这不要求复述感官细节，但仍缺少对应的心理原因。\"\n    }\n  ],\n\n  \"wordy\": [\n    {\n      \"ids\": [\n        \"S06-2\"\n      ],\n      \"why\": \"“把心思放回眼前愿意做的关心”搭配生硬，把“眼前”与“愿意做的关心”直接粘连；改成“把心思放回眼前，愿意关心就去关心”更自然。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"ids\": [\n        \"S06-4\"\n      ],\n      \"why\": \"“仍不知道对方怎么想”与“不能替对方回答”重复表达心意不可知，而且前半句把独处比喻具体化；可压缩为“即使相处再好，他仍无法确定对方的心意，所以会酸楚”。\"\n    }\n  ]\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "aae599b2-7de9-44d8-8a67-5d5c29adf570", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T052520583063Z", "elapsed_seconds": 291.703, "completed_utc": "2026-10-29T05:30:12.299544+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "2cf6b345a6edef1ff1f098b3c967d44181f3bd06eb876228250a6ce074f1a58b", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T052520583063Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "52ba1657203a50648db1edd81032db01b4c301aeeb63ad32cdae55d9b67a833b"}}}
